[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11227.03, "timestamp": "03:07:07", "text": "有一种方法可以追踪人。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11233.75, "timestamp": "03:07:13", "text": "我看到了你的名字。我的天啊。你做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11241.349, "timestamp": "03:07:21", "text": "隧道。很有趣，不是吗？这很有趣，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11243.99, "timestamp": "03:07:23", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11248.71, "timestamp": "03:07:28", "text": "作弊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11253.99, "timestamp": "03:07:33", "text": "是啊，太容易了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11258.79, "timestamp": "03:07:38", "text": "但真的很难做到。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11275.91, "timestamp": "03:07:55", "text": "无人机。呃，我的过滤器。哦，这对你有帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11279.19, "timestamp": "03:07:59", "text": "好像你很熟悉这条小巷，对吧？"}]